     * @see TypeVarBoundedType
     * @see <a href="http://docs.oracle.com/javase/specs/jls/se5.0/html/typesValues.html#4.4">http://docs.oracle.com/javase/specs/jls/se5.0/html/typesValues.html#4.4</a>
