     * <pre>
     * Partial p = new Partial()
     *     .with(DateTimeFieldType.dayOfWeek(), 5)
     *     .with(DateTimeFieldType.hourOfDay(), 12)
     *     .with(DateTimeFieldType.minuteOfHour(), 20);
