     * 1975      1925..2024      2000    2020    1940    1960    1980
     * 2000      1950..2049      2000    2020    2040    1960    1980
     * 2025      1975..2074      2000    2020    2040    2060    1980
     * 2050      2000..2099      2000    2020    2040    2060    2080
     * </pre>
